<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">spatial-stitching</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

A spool of enchanted thread, reclaimed from unraveled work and spun
again finer than before. Measure it and the spool holds more length than
its size should allow, coil after coil paying out long after the spool
ought to have emptied. Stitched into a seam, it leaves the seam holding
more than the cloth around it was ever meant to.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting_circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Binding Paste (x1), Chrysalis Setting (x1),
               Mutation Catalyst (x1)

